<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Thursday show that net currency reserves fell to about 102.0 billion marks in the week ending June 30 from about 102.7 billion in the week ending June 23.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    June 30	 June 23</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     117.9	   118.4</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   15.9	    15.7</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
